{0 ocgtk index}

The {b ocgtk} package provides OCaml bindings to GTK4 and its supporting
libraries. Each namespace below is a separate sub-library; the
[.generated_stubs*] libraries (pure C stubs with no OCaml modules, used
internally to link the generated bindings) are omitted from this index.

{1 Library ocgtk}

The entry point of this library is the module {!Ocgtk}.

{1 Library ocgtk.cairo}

The entry point of this library is the module {!Ocgtk_cairo}.

{1 Library ocgtk.common}

This library exposes the following toplevel modules:

{ul
{- {!Bounded_int} }
{- {!GError} }
{- {!Glib} }
{- {!Glib_bytes} }
{- {!Gobject} }
{- {!Gsize} }
{- {!Gvariant} }
{- {!Gvariant_type} }
{- {!Int16} }
{- {!Int32} }
{- {!Int8} }
{- {!Ocgtk_common} }
{- {!UInt16} }
{- {!UInt32} }
{- {!UInt64} }
{- {!UInt8} }
}

{1 Library ocgtk.gdk}

The entry point of this library is the module {!Ocgtk_gdk}.

{1 Library ocgtk.gdkpixbuf}

The entry point of this library is the module {!Ocgtk_gdkpixbuf}.

{1 Library ocgtk.gio}

The entry point of this library is the module {!Ocgtk_gio}.

